<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HALLE, Germany 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $875,000 German grass-court men's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Michael Stich (Germany) beat Bernd Karbacher (Germany) 4-6 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) beat Franz Stauder (Germany) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 3-6 1-0 (Prinosil retired injured)</p>
</text>
